mapping "W5172.1" source="W5172" target="220872000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 1 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W5172 SNOMED CT 220872000 = Struck/bumped against another person, farm area, during paid
        work. Target SNOMED CT 40421852 (concept_code 220872000) = [X]Striking against or bumped into by
        another person, occurrence on farm. The SNOMED CT place-specific event concept fully contains the
        source (every farm-area striking/bumping event is a farm occurrence); the activity dimension
        (paid work) has no SNOMED CT representation, so the target is broader. High tier: the SNOMED CT [X]
        concept is the standard representation of the ICD-10 W51.7 farm-occurrence code, and the Swedish
        code W517x is the Swedish national extension of that same W51.7 category with an added activity
        suffix.
        """
}
